        "a1": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What’s inside",
            "text": "<p>19 ingredients in 2 capsules. Every amount is on the label, so you can check it.</p><p><strong>NR (300mg).</strong> The main one. A form of vitamin B3 that your body uses to make NAD+. 300mg is the most allowed in the UK.</p><p><strong>8 B vitamins, in their active form.</strong> Your body can use them straight away. They help reduce tiredness and help your body get energy from food.</p><p><strong>Vitamin D3 and K2.</strong> Vitamin D helps keep your muscles and bones working normally. K2 works alongside it.</p><p><strong>Zinc and copper.</strong> They help protect your cells.</p><p><strong>CoQ10 and PQQ.</strong> Found in every cell. Your body makes less CoQ10 as you get older.</p><p><strong>Grape seed, resveratrol and BioPerine® (black pepper extract).</strong> Plant extracts. BioPerine helps your body take in the rest.</p><p>No caffeine. No fillers. Vegan.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a2": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it safe?",
            "text": "<p>Made in the UK. An outside lab checks every batch.</p><p>Take medicine? Ask your doctor first.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a3": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to take it",
            "text": "<p>Take 2 capsules with breakfast. Every day. That’s it.</p>"
